{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1000_p", "source_sha256": "18af60ab94cdc25f2e82ef22955cb77421a47c525666ac5b00334f003ab070d6", "ja": "（『D/Zeal』のリバイバル公演、開演前。\n静香は、いつも以上に気合いが入っている気がする）", "zh": "（『D/Zeal』复出演出开始前。\n静香好像比平时还要干劲十足）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d246dcdcc123f8d839375487973b4c34e3841d2af36162a7382ba5090ab668b", "ja": "ふぅ……。", "zh": "呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1002_p", "source_sha256": "594845465ee66865b31da121e6f28d36a3ba2b066611d7cce1c6f58de5c7c8dd", "ja": "静香、お疲れさま。\n大丈夫か？　かなり緊張してるみたいだけど。", "zh": "静香，辛苦了。\n没事吧？看起来你挺紧张的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "78fa3123c2cd9ab1a1ed835a24f13b85107eeb9e52c77c2626528c009c2b8467", "ja": "ち、違います！　これは緊張じゃなくて、\n集中しているんです。話しかけないでくださいっ。", "zh": "不、不是！这不是紧张，是我正在集中精神。请不要和我说话！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1004_p", "source_sha256": "fa464d0b594e2539ed9ecabc5865ccff433d3a0c89739582ec09a3393c78c4be", "ja": "そうか……。\nなあ静香、打ち上げはどこがいいと思う？", "zh": "这样啊……  \n静香，你觉得庆功宴去哪里比较好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1005_015siz", "source_sha256": "9d349f37bcca307c487cc0d0d551fc51e5572ca2f63a9a8ff1f134db1cabb402", "ja": "え、なんですか、いきなり……。", "zh": "诶，怎么突然问这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f3dfd68c39e3a9631b43f4b2a5614997c700ce4b208ce449f77045bf9df5eedf", "ja": "今日の打ち上げのお店だよ。\n希望があったら、聞いておきたいんだ。", "zh": "是今天庆功宴的店。要是有什么想去的地方，我想先听听你的意见。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1007_015siz", "source_sha256": "12b472d42fd34d3e6dc9a5e7046837d21d825c2f4ea6ae27593a50ed0e77cd05", "ja": "別にどこでも、うどんなら……。\nって、邪魔しないでくださいってば！　もうっ。", "zh": "其实哪里都行，只要有乌冬面就……  \n真是的，都说了别来打扰我！真是的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1008_p", "source_sha256": "4c83d3d2557741f463869e657a5ff50ea8a7e543ca03aff00af310049bf31de9", "ja": "はは、ごめんごめん。でも、肩に力が入りすぎてると\n思って。もうちょっとリラックスしたらどうだ？", "zh": "哈哈，抱歉抱歉。不过，我觉得你肩膀绷得太紧了。要不要再放松一点？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "d98a240995eb6294211df8e7983534969c34a925f8816276d73f6cd7c5cdd806", "ja": "うっ……それは……。\nはあ……。", "zh": "唔……这确实是……\n唉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "3ae3659ae899fe382934e6b6a6f55ecc49a01d5e349d9b99a2a51ac4efbd8bc6", "ja": "{$P$}の言う通りです……。\n少し力が入りすぎていたかもしれませんね。", "zh": "{$P$}说得对……\n我也许确实有点用力过猛了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1011_p", "source_sha256": "78eed309cda43f1bd71004ad8a88b3bce23f5201d4c13931a3709c8bee7e915e", "ja": "まあ、公演にかける想いはわかるけどな。\n自主練も相当してたみたいだし。", "zh": "不过，我也能理解你对这场演出的重视。\n而且你私下里好像也做了相当多的自主练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "2570e3f3c87bd64b83f5c8ad1f55bb4c5fc7934b50c81ea1239c4ced97ee9fce", "ja": "はい。私の全てを、\nぶつけるつもりで練習してきましたから。", "zh": "是的。因为我一直都是抱着倾注自己全部的决心来练习的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1013_015siz", "source_sha256": "fc4ddc76671b1110bcdc19ecf1abcf29e61a21aeee49439d866d88d955050a76", "ja": "今の私が、どこまで通じるのか確かめたい。\nそう思ったら、余計な力が入っていたみたいです。", "zh": "我想确认一下，现在的我究竟能做到什么程度。\n这么一想，好像反而使出了多余的力气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "80ee07f247285a06dbb228f53f5670e2b8c5ce888280742dd53a60d0318b6b4d", "ja": "公演は楽しみです。楽しみですけど……\nジュリアさんには、負けたくないですから！", "zh": "我很期待这次演出。我是很期待，不过……\n我可不想输给茱莉亚先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1015_p", "source_sha256": "521875f7ba47e8066c099708c064e0d78e83a99da951e8c6adc838c4ebc6422f", "ja": "うん。そういう気持ちなら、心配なさそうだな。\nおっと……そろそろだけど、準備はいいか？", "zh": "嗯。有这种心态的话，看来就不用担心了。\n哎呀……时间差不多了，准备好了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "ba91ffaac6f4ad5f156145b9d04719223febd700c12ae919aca7085268e83202", "ja": "大丈夫です！　お願いします！", "zh": "没问题！拜托您了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1017_p", "source_sha256": "a67d1906435bcf6c1c684fdf1c6e33c1acf7c187a057b6c70d31f9469394b039", "ja": "わかった。それじゃあ、頑張って。\n打ち上げのうどんを楽しみにしておいてくれ！", "zh": "知道了。那就加油吧。\n期待着庆功宴上的乌冬面吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0213_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0213_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "3dd431ba20a023f1e86d033442e65ea255c45b45234bed7ec7152fce7c671b60", "ja": "えっ、本当……い、いや、今それはいいですから！\n行ってきますね、{$P$}！", "zh": "诶，真的吗……不、不，现在那个就先不用了！\n我出发了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
